scriba (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New module (scriba exception): log a Guile exception's type, message and
    trace through any backend, each rendering it in its own idiom.
  * New documentation page comparing Scriba with the logging libraries of other
    languages, with measured throughput.
  * Public API declared stable.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:15:00 +0100

